sequenceDiagram
    actor Human
    participant WebUI
    participant API as agent-tasks API
    participant GitHub
    participant DB

    Note over Human,DB: 1. Login
    Human->>WebUI: Login with GitHub
    WebUI->>API: GET /api/auth/github
    API-->>Human: redirect to GitHub authorize
    GitHub->>API: GET /api/auth/github/callback?code
    API->>GitHub: exchange code, fetch user
    API->>DB: upsert user
    API-->>WebUI: session cookie, redirect /home

    Note over Human,DB: 2. Later: explicit repo sync by a team member
    Human->>API: POST /api/teams/:id/sync
    API->>GitHub: list repos visible to this user
    API->>DB: update or create one project per repo
    API->>DB: delete team projects whose repo is not in the list
